      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SARILDA (8) flew the lids with a fast early split last time, hitting the frame with a neck second (30.16) over 520m at this track and making it two placings on end. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Top chance in this line up. WARM HUGS (1) produced a moderate run last time when seventh at Q Lakeside over 550m behind Surrealist (31.21) in a Grade 4/5. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Should be about the money. FIVE BIRDIES (2) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (30.20) at this track. Has a good record here at this journey. Expected to be in the finish again. TOTE DEOR (3) will need to repeat last run to feature.",
